{"data": {"node": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "31389821173999843", "organization": {"id": "752736511256331", "viewer_permissions": [], "application_groupings": {"nodes": [{"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "1413570848506224"}]}, "id": "947132094886304"}, {"viewer_has_update_access": false, "full_applications": {"nodes": [{"id": "31389821173999843"}]}, "id": "4574501322776663"}]}}, "firstRevision": {"nodes": [{"application": {"id": "31389821173999843", "release_date": 1772283600, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "34706874115627849"}, "id": "1102733285398659"}]}}, "binary": null, "live_binary": null, "created_date": 1793781330, "id": "39761104153538128", "is_initial_release": false, "name_with_fallback": "v11", "pdp_metadata_with_fallback": {"version": 9, "application": {"is_concept": false, "latest_released_pdp_metadata": {"id": "39761161120199098"}, "release_status": "RELEASED", "id": "31389821173999843"}, "id": "39761161120199098", "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED"}, "release_date": null, "administration_status": "APPROVED", "is_first": false, "release_status": "RELEASED", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "31389821173999843", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app_ads": false, "is_concept": false, "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF"}, "iarc_cert": {"id": "1571375114279987"}, "iarc_email": null, "msrp": null, "translations": {"nodes": [{"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2035849143768329", "locale": "fr_FR", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Painted Realms Demo", "keywords": ["aventure", "peinture", "sandbox", "cozy", "mignon"], "long_description": "\ud83d\udc7e Rejoignez-nous sur **Discord**: https://discord.gg/dH8uKv7tm7 \ud83d\udc7e\n# Rejoignez les Restaurateurs !\n\nDans le mus\u00e9e magique \"Les Coquelicots\", les peintures sont des portails vers des mondes vivants ! Incarnez une restauratrice d'art et utilisez vos pinceaux pour sauver les peintures d'un myst\u00e9rieux Effaceur. Version actuelle : **d\u00e9mo**.\n\n**Art immersif** - Red\u00e9couvrez des \u0153uvres c\u00e9l\u00e8bres transpos\u00e9es en environnements 3D immersifs\n{1671391980485996}\n\n**Restauration** - Trouvez les diff\u00e9rences entre les originaux (2D) et les tableaux immersifs (3D) et redessinez ce qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 effac\u00e9.\n{1100400108837436}\n\n**Libert\u00e9 cr\u00e9ative** - Aidez les visiteurs du mus\u00e9e en compl\u00e9tant des qu\u00eates cr\u00e9atives. R\u00e9veillez l'artiste qui sommeille en vous !\n{1557564002151951}\n\n**Sandbox** - Customisez le mus\u00e9e \u00e0 l'aide d'outils fun et faciles \u00e0 prendre en main, comme le pinceau magique qui transforme les dessins 2D en objets 3D !\n{2292515427851520}\n\n\n# Demo vs. Jeu Complet\n\nCette d\u00e9mo est un avant-go\u00fbt du jeu complet en cours de cr\u00e9ation. Voici un aper\u00e7u de ce qui vous attend dans le jeu final :\n\n**+ de contenu** : Une aventure de 2 heures avec plusieurs galeries \u00e0 explorer, plus de tableaux \u00e0 restaurer et de nouveaux visiteurs \u00e0 rencontrer et \u00e0 aider.\n\n**Une histoire compl\u00e8te** : Enqu\u00eatez sur l'identit\u00e9 de l'Effaceur et d\u00e9couvrez une histoire sur les th\u00e8mes de la cr\u00e9ativit\u00e9 et de la confiance en soi.\n\n**+ d'outils cr\u00e9atifs** : Plus de pinceaux, comme un pistolet \u00e0 couleurs ! Ce sera encore plus facile et amusant de personnaliser votre mus\u00e9e et de compl\u00e9ter les side quests artistiques.\n\n\ud83d\udc7e Discord: https://discord.gg/dH8uKv7tm7", "short_description": "Incarnez une restauratrice d'art capable d'entrer \u00e0 l'int\u00e9rieur des peintures ! Explorez des tableaux c\u00e9l\u00e8bres, redessinez ce qui manque et sauvez le mus\u00e9e du myst\u00e9rieux Effaceur.\n\n*Version D\u00e9mo* "}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "PaintedRealmsLogo_TransparentBg.png", "id": "1501013481175421", "image_type": "APP_IMG_MARKDOWN_INLINE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618910_1501013484508754_2505749268124110971_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9UBtiM3p6aQQ7kNvwEsznOe&_nc_oc=Adp5F1uK6mx2aDhakDTxoQck9X3WaRhWGNFuVBEd1Rs0COgBrSo9ZM9BNJZT2sOhI5U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtnOZ3ADC8EN8HoakwAMmgQVJOLK_NwJG7zsNFySa9NQ&oe=6AFB2047"}, {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape_2.3.png", "id": "1508281216907957", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619680_1508281220241290_2888557228361904172_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fDkILrZ2FcUQ7kNvwFB07l2&_nc_oc=AdqOvWI8gKeJrN1N4Suk9H5EKoBbsAQa1Ko4rGO0SalDPCByJZm9njaCqSXXWQuw1Gc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR2a0omRaU_PC-I3ZYktymEBXve6_ULIq5hay4Aup8PaQ&oe=6AFB4A8C"}, {"file_name": "PaintedRealms_CoverImageHero.png", "id": "1318867373312922", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619113_1318867383312921_6482859639422436600_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BEVE3LWyaWAQ7kNvwFr9DM6&_nc_oc=AdpC4NJ6y6_xW4q311SmqeD19fBanzkG55tCnwKR-LR-PFNXdsoV_3bSOBNV68dOCXU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR74RH_0L3Yg12KwaGgTYuGUF8-GOlzLn2_ttz2lwN9YA&oe=6AFB4366"}, {"file_name": "PaintedRealms_CoverImagePortrait.png", "id": "1197855208861470", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820058_1197855212194803_2663272450921361275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=waHBMdO_N6oQ7